<title>DENMARK: Danish February new car yr/yr sales rose 18.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Danish February new car yr/yr sales rose 18.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish new car registrations rose 18.3 percent in February 1997 to 12,482 from 10,554 a year earlier, the Automobile Importers' Society said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				     Feb 1997   Feb 1996</p>
<p>    New car registrations	12,482    10,554</p>
<p>Leading February registrations by manufacturer</p>
<p>    Volkswagen AG	 1,483</p>
<p>    Toyota		  1,468</p>
<p>    Ford Motor Co	 1,346</p>
<p>    General Motors Corp 1,281</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen Newsroom, +45-33-96965</p>
</text>
